            <div xml:id="d235">

                <pb facs="0545" n="409" xml:id="pg409"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">551.58B1/62: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-20T12:00:00+01:00">July 20,
                        1929—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>57. Your cipher telegram 74, July 16, noon. I signed convention and the protocol
                    for the suppression of counterfeiting on Saturday morning, July 20.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
